      "q": "How much federal contract money goes to Tennessee?",
      "a": "Tennessee received $10.6B in federal contract obligations in FY2026 to date. The state recorded 18,656 awards with an average award size of $568K, and obligations fell down 3.2% year over year. Historical annual totals ranged from $10.6B to $11.4B between FY21 and FY26."
    },
    {
      "q": "Which agencies award the most contracts in Tennessee?",
